==========================================================================
u(21)=57 STRUCTURAL AUDIT vs the repo's '57 = 20 spine + 37 hex bulk'
(genuine AMP arXiv:2412.11914 graphs; author = Alexeev-MIXON-PARSHALL,
 NOT 'Alexeev-Tikhonov' as the repo repeatedly states)
==========================================================================
centered-hex numbers C_hex(k)=3k(k+1)+1: {1: 7, 2: 19, 3: 37, 4: 61}
NOTE: the repo reads 37 as C_hex(3). But C_hex(3)=37 is the number of
POINTS in a 3-ring hexagon, whose unit-distance EDGE count is 9*3^2+3*3=90,
not 37.  So '37 bulk edges = centered-hex' conflates a POINT count with an
EDGE count from the start.

